# Periodic jobs run by the scheduler service (supercronic, see docker-compose.yml).
#
# Format: standard 5-field cron + command.
#   minute  hour  day-of-month  month  day-of-week  command
# All times are UTC (the container's clock).
#
# Each command invokes a Python module that wraps its body in
# `fx_pulse.jobs.track_run`, so every run is recorded in the `job_runs`
# table and surfaced on the Grafana dashboard.
#
# To add a job:
#   1. Write fx_pulse/<job_name>.py using `with track_run(conn, "<job_name>"):`.
#   2. Add one cron line below.
#   3. Add a `make <job_name>` target for manual triggers.
#
# (No jobs scheduled yet — the framework lands first.)
